1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:05,372
Rule one of the night shift. If something is wrong with a customer, don't serve it.

2
00:00:05,922 --> 00:00:09,068
Ten pork skewers and sticky rice, please. Extra chili.

3
00:00:09,348 --> 00:00:10,199
Coming up.

4
00:00:10,922 --> 00:00:13,901
Uncle, do you have anything that is not on the menu?

5
00:00:14,181 --> 00:00:14,625
No.

6
00:00:14,905 --> 00:00:15,445
Okay.

7
00:00:16,122 --> 00:00:18,352
Pork. No chili. I never have chili.

8
00:00:18,632 --> 00:00:22,113
...She has her back to me. And it isn't raining.

9
00:00:22,663 --> 00:00:23,735
Who was wrong?

10
00:00:27,663 --> 00:00:30,977
She never turned around. A raincoat on a dry night.
